WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.153 --> 00:00:15.722
"Oh Ivy thought as she and Glen ran to Ezra.

2
00:00:16.622 --> 00:00:20.165
By accident, he'd switched on the PA system with his elbow.

3
00:00:21.205 --> 00:00:23.467
Glen reached over and turned off the switch.

4
00:00:24.367 --> 00:00:27.930
Ezra quickly said good-bye to his parents and ended his call.

5
00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:29.911
He looked panicked.

6
00:00:31.524 --> 00:00:34.566
"Did everyone in camp just hear my phone call?"

7
00:00:34.586 --> 00:00:39.189
"Um, only part of it," Ivy said.

8
00:00:39.209 --> 00:00:42.051
"Yeah, only part of it."

9
00:00:43.112 --> 00:00:44.493
Glen patted him on the back.

10
00:00:44.513 --> 00:00:46.654
"The worst part."

11
00:00:46.674 --> 00:00:50.617
"Ugh!" Ezra groaned.

12
00:00:51.958 --> 00:00:54.660
Glen grabbed some more brownies and put the box away.

13
00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:59.063
"Here, Ezra, have a brownie.

14
00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:02.641
Actually—have four brownies."

15
00:01:04.423 --> 00:01:07.225
Ezra tried to eat one, but he was too worried.

16
00:01:07.245 --> 00:01:09.547
"I feel sick."

17
00:01:11.068 --> 00:01:12.829
So Glen ate the brownies for him.

18
00:01:16.532 --> 00:01:17.813
The kids left the office.

19
00:01:20.115 --> 00:01:23.638
Outside, the Ucks were waiting along with Clara and Willow.

20
00:01:23.658 --> 00:01:26.801
"Hey, Snuggy Wuggy!"

21
00:01:27.141 --> 00:01:27.841
Chuck yelled.

22
00:01:28.562 --> 00:01:30.183
The Ucks roared with laughter.

23
00:01:31.064 --> 00:01:34.265
"Do you miss your mommy and daddy, Snuggy Wuggy?"

24
00:01:34.645 --> 00:01:35.325
Huck asked.

25
00:01:36.445 --> 00:01:38.126
Clara frowned at the three boys.

26
00:01:38.146 --> 00:01:42.047
"I think it's sweet that Ezra misses his parents."

27
00:01:43.727 --> 00:01:44.428
"Me too!"

28
00:01:44.888 --> 00:01:45.588
Willow said.

29
00:01:46.688 --> 00:01:48.649
That just made the Ucks laugh harder.

30
00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:53.070
Ivy looked at Ezra and saw that his face was bright red.

31
00:01:53.090 --> 00:01:56.391
"Cut it out," she said to the Ucks.

32
00:01:56.411 --> 00:01:59.532
"Hey, where's our candy?"

33
00:01:59.932 --> 00:02:01.888
Huck asked, holding out his hand.

34
00:02:03.049 --> 00:02:04.209
Ivy crossed her arms.

35
00:02:04.969 --> 00:02:06.870
"You're not getting any candy from us!"

36
00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:11.591
"Ha-ha! Ivy's kidding," Glen said.

37
00:02:11.611 --> 00:02:13.852
"See, here's your candy."

38
00:02:15.492 --> 00:02:19.053
He emptied his pockets and gave the other campers all his candy.

39
00:02:19.073 --> 00:02:21.154
"Thanks, Glen!"

40
00:02:21.654 --> 00:02:23.174
Clara and Willow said together.

41
00:02:24.194 --> 00:02:28.476
The Ucks didn't thank him because they were too busy stuffing candy into their mouths.

42
00:02:31.464 --> 00:02:32.105
Soon Mrs.

43
00:02:32.165 --> 00:02:34.566
Matsak returned from inspecting the cabins.

44
00:02:35.527 --> 00:02:37.969
The kids quickly hid their candy behind their backs.

45
00:02:37.989 --> 00:02:42.111
"Private wants everyone at the ball field," she said.

46
00:02:42.131 --> 00:02:44.873
"It's time for the baseball game!"

47
00:02:46.354 --> 00:02:49.056
When the game started, Ivy was in right field.

48
00:02:49.717 --> 00:02:51.198
Glen was playing center field.

49
00:02:52.298 --> 00:02:53.759
Ivy moved closer to Glen.

50
00:02:53.779 --> 00:02:58.002
"I can't believe you gave all your candy to the Ucks!

51
00:02:58.743 --> 00:03:00.324
They were teasing Ezra."

52
00:03:01.696 --> 00:03:02.917
Glen kicked at the grass.

53
00:03:02.937 --> 00:03:07.282
"I didn't give them all my candy.

54
00:03:07.302 --> 00:03:10.125
You still have some in your pockets."

55
00:03:11.346 --> 00:03:12.387
Ivy glared at him.

56
00:03:12.407 --> 00:03:16.711
"Yeah, I do, and you're not getting it back!

57
00:03:17.672 --> 00:03:19.194
You'll just waste it on the Ucks."

58
00:03:20.195 --> 00:03:23.118
Ezra was on the other team, and now he was at bat.

59
00:03:23.918 --> 00:03:25.120
He stepped up to the plate.

60
00:03:28.932 --> 00:03:30.714
"Snuggy Wuggy!

61
00:03:30.774 --> 00:03:32.635
Snuggy Wuggy!"

62
00:03:33.076 --> 00:03:34.677
Chuck chanted from third base.

63
00:03:37.199 --> 00:03:38.621
Ezra swung and missed.

64
00:03:40.522 --> 00:03:42.104
Now more kids were chanting.

65
00:03:42.124 --> 00:03:44.826
"Snuggy Wuggy!

66
00:03:44.986 --> 00:03:47.148
Snuggy Wuggy!"

67
00:03:48.189 --> 00:03:50.591
Ezra quickly got two more strikes.

68
00:03:50.811 --> 00:03:51.552
He was out.

69
00:03:53.073 --> 00:03:55.996
Slowly he walked back to the bench and slumped down.

70
00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:59.721
Ivy punched her fist into her glove.

71
00:03:59.741 --> 00:04:03.183
"I want to teach the Ucks a lesson somehow!"

72
00:04:03.203 --> 00:04:05.564
"What will you teach them?

73
00:04:07.005 --> 00:04:09.326
I don't think they like drawing," Glen said.

74
00:04:09.346 --> 00:04:12.808
"We have to stop them," Ivy said.

75
00:04:12.828 --> 00:04:14.669
"They're bullies.

76
00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:19.212
They took all your candy, and they won't stop teasing Ezra.

77
00:04:20.973 --> 00:04:22.133
Maybe we could scare them!"

78
00:04:22.153 --> 00:04:25.055
"The Ucks didn't take my candy.

79
00:04:25.955 --> 00:04:26.736
I gave it to them.

80
00:04:27.884 --> 00:04:30.286
And now they're my friends," Glen said.

81
00:04:30.306 --> 00:04:34.409
"I can just talk to them and tell them to leave Ezra alone.

82
00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:35.991
They'll listen to me."

83
00:04:37.612 --> 00:04:38.873
Ivy raised one eyebrow.

84
00:04:38.893 --> 00:04:40.494
"Oh, really?

85
00:04:41.135 --> 00:04:43.577
That's all it takes a little chat?"

86
00:04:44.958 --> 00:04:46.239
"Yep!" Glen said.

87
00:04:46.259 --> 00:04:47.700
"Just wait.

88
00:04:48.461 --> 00:04:49.061
You'll see."

89
00:04:49.902 --> 00:04:51.163
Huck was the next batter.

90
00:04:53.485 --> 00:04:57.408
As the ball crossed the plate, he swung the bat, making a loud crack.

91
00:04:58.196 --> 00:04:59.139
The ball popped up.

92
00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:02.586
It was heading to the outfield, right toward Ivy and
